## Git workflow

- Commit messages: Conventional Commits type/scope in English, description/body in Russian.
- Application repos: work on feature branches; merge feature branches into `dev` for stage, then release `dev` into `main` for prod.
- Do not commit directly to `main` or `dev` unless the user explicitly asks or this repo has no branch model yet.
- WikiPedik is the exception: wiki memory commits go directly to WikiPedik `main` through `wiki sync --commit/--push`.

