## Secrets

- All secrets live in `${VAULT}` vault, with scoped item names:
  `_company__<VAR>`, `<product>__<VAR>`, or `<product>__<repo>__<VAR>`.
- Add secrets through `secret add --company`, `secret add --product`, or
  `secret add --repo`; this appends a `secret-cache` export to the matching
  company/product/repo `.envrc`.
- Reference for 1Password, direnv, `.envrc`, env vars:
